no kills him in the first, in the other two De Niro kills Pacino.", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-03T13:06:24Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Not counting Godfather II, of course, since they never shared screen in it.", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-03T13:07:13Z", "username": "Shubham", "text": "One of the other two, I remember was a flop on the box office. Can't remember the name.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-03T13:08:05Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Yeah, it wasn't a good movie either. Quite disappointing a watch, really", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-03T13:10:46Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Trying a simple one- A short man's failed attempt to save Lutetia from what could have been a plague", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-03T13:12:19Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Napolean?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-03T13:12:31Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Nope", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-03T13:13:11Z", "username": "Shubham", "text": "I remember this name Lutetia, but can't remember the movie.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-03T13:13:47Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "The movie isn't set in the era it sounds from the description", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-03T13:14:11Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Think I did a bad job at explaining plots badly 😂😅", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": f